{
  "activity": "ExcelApplicationCard",
  "package": "UiPath.Excel.Activities",
  "coded": [
    {
      "call": "excel.UseExcelFile",
      "scope": "using",
      "init": {
        "param": "options",
        "type": "UseOptions",
        "props": {
          "Path": "{WorkbookPath}",
          "SaveChanges": "{AutoSave}",
          "CreateIfNotExist": "{CreateNewFile}",
          "ReadOnly": "{ReadOnly}",
          "KeepExcelOpen": "{KeepExcelFileOpen}",
          "Password": ["{Password}", "new System.Net.NetworkCredential(string.Empty, {SecurePassword}).Password"],
          "EditPassword": ["{EditPassword}", "new System.Net.NetworkCredential(string.Empty, {SecureEditPassword}).Password"],
          "ReadFormatting": "UiPath.Excel.ReadFormattingOptions.{ReadFormatting}",
          "ResizeWindow": "UiPath.Excel.Model.ResizeWindowOptions.{ResizeWindow}",
          "SensitivityOperation": "UiPath.Excel.ExcelLabelOperation.{SensitivityOperation}",
          "SensitivityLabel": "(UiPath.Excel.IExcelLabelObject){SensitivityLabel}",
          "ExcelProcess": "{@IExcelProcess}"
        }
      },
      "defaults": { "AutoSave": true, "CreateNewFile": true },
      "usings": ["UiPath.Excel", "UiPath.Excel.Activities.API", "UiPath.Excel.Activities.API.Models"]
    }
  ],
  "ignore": ["Visible", "UseTemplate", "TemplatePath"],
  "notes": "using (var Excel = excel.UseExcelFile(new UseOptions { ... })) { 子 } にする。変数名は IR の item（Studio の既定は Excel）。AutoSave / CreateNewFile はアクティビティの既定（true）を defaults で明示する（UseOptions の既定に頼らない）。Excel Process Scope の中なら ExcelProcess にそのスコープの変数を渡す（{@IExcelProcess}）。Visible / UseTemplate / TemplatePath は Studio に出ない（Browsable=false）プロパティで、UseOptions に対応が無いので捨てる"
}
